        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1dfa13ed-f6ae-3b55-ad0e-9a4d6e9cea01",
                "word": "brutalement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7511222d-40e8-3252-9cc7-818832d574b9",
                        "entry_id": "1dfa13ed-f6ae-3b55-ad0e-9a4d6e9cea01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Avec brutalité ; violemment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bdeda80-858d-47cd-992f-2c7c3b1dc43f",
                                "sense_id": "7511222d-40e8-3252-9cc7-818832d574b9",
                                "text": "Reprenez tout ce sang de qui la lâcheté a si brutalement souillé la pureté."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbcb47b5-96c0-31eb-9cd4-9f5ef5e3e4df",
                        "entry_id": "1dfa13ed-f6ae-3b55-ad0e-9a4d6e9cea01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Soudainement ; de manière inattendue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eea433be-a1f5-4ffa-a075-fd00f2207b55",
                                "sense_id": "bbcb47b5-96c0-31eb-9cd4-9f5ef5e3e4df",
                                "text": "D'un seul coup, brutalement, le flotteur gauche s'engagea. Je fus emmené dans un « cheval de bois » à gauche, que je pus contrecarrer quelque peu en accélérant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45dab9c5-0a7a-4ac1-a3d1-51e3b9d67afd",
                                "sense_id": "bbcb47b5-96c0-31eb-9cd4-9f5ef5e3e4df",
                                "text": "Il hocha la tête, soupirant, s’avouant très bas, que peut-être il eût préféré que Jeanne noçât sans rien lui dire, plutôt que de l’abandonner brutalement ainsi."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42bbef33-31cc-469f-919e-b3e3ca0dca94",
                                "sense_id": "bbcb47b5-96c0-31eb-9cd4-9f5ef5e3e4df",
                                "text": "Pris d’un zèle soudain, il redéposa son fardeau dans la camionnette, bondit à son volant, et dégagea le véhicule avec une telle brusquerie, qu’un conducteur, trop serré, freina brutalement, et l’agonit d'insultes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ee3261e-3a7a-4a92-b801-8de9146d2cbe",
                        "source_entry_id": "1dfa13ed-f6ae-3b55-ad0e-9a4d6e9cea01",
                        "target_lang_word": "brutally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brutally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7967b522-29f2-3d54-b29b-437d498bf54e",
                                        "entry_id": "c8ee9e32-b8ca-37f5-ae7f-c25e57fc285a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a brutal manner; viciously, barbarically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee8da920-30eb-407f-8895-a1a21520e706",
                                                "sense_id": "7967b522-29f2-3d54-b29b-437d498bf54e",
                                                "text": "From another point of view, it was a place without a soul. The well-to-do had hearts of stone; the rich were brutally bumptious; the Press, the Municipality, all the public men, were ridiculously, vaingloriously self-satisfied."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1e9b44f-8e5d-44f0-9889-01b2e2089c27",
                                                "sense_id": "7967b522-29f2-3d54-b29b-437d498bf54e",
                                                "text": "\"You sit there,\" said Henry brutally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd3a58f2-e0af-4e1a-87f2-5e993cb14173",
                                                "sense_id": "7967b522-29f2-3d54-b29b-437d498bf54e",
                                                "text": "England's World Cup dreams fell apart under a French onslaught on a night when their shortcomings were brutally exposed at the quarter-final stage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d2dd673-371d-4109-9dc9-087091ffd6aa",
                                                "sense_id": "7967b522-29f2-3d54-b29b-437d498bf54e",
                                                "text": "And this year, some of the granite facades have a new addition - the blue and yellow of the flag of Ukraine. It's hardly surprising to see the Scots, a nation more attuned to independence than some, showing solidarity with a country brutally invaded by Russia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f61490a5-8ebc-3941-86f2-19952db389a8",
                                        "entry_id": "c8ee9e32-b8ca-37f5-ae7f-c25e57fc285a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a direct way that does not attempt to hide, disguise, or mask unpleasantness; directly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a9deeea-b39f-48f3-b3e9-375a11e561ea",
                                                "sense_id": "f61490a5-8ebc-3941-86f2-19952db389a8",
                                                "text": "He was not an expert but he was brutally honest by saying he couldn’t help the customer find a solution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0216bd6-feaf-42e4-9462-1212bb4b6af7",
                                                "sense_id": "f61490a5-8ebc-3941-86f2-19952db389a8",
                                                "text": "Beeching concludes, rather brutally, that \"a high proportion of stopping passenger train services ought to be discontinued as soon as possible... and as soon as procedure permits\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d28c4d48-27a9-3a0e-87ec-54368edf95ee",
                                        "entry_id": "c8ee9e32-b8ca-37f5-ae7f-c25e57fc285a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91ee6079-77b5-460b-a6b0-48e078bde3bd",
                                                "sense_id": "d28c4d48-27a9-3a0e-87ec-54368edf95ee",
                                                "text": "You know, I am so glad I never did it with someone I had lukewarm feelings for. Christian is brutally hot, and I am going to remember tonight forever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75009181-6c28-4fcc-a394-da3a7f0a8b60",
                                                "sense_id": "d28c4d48-27a9-3a0e-87ec-54368edf95ee",
                                                "text": "The first piece of the night is Shostakovich. Its first movement is a sedate, haunting, almost melodramatic nocturne, but before too long the concerto changes gear and becomes energetic, discordant, feral. It's lengthy, too, a real work-out, and much of it is brutally difficult to execute. He's on form tonight. Close to flawless, and his audience — which he cannot see or hear — seems rapt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dd5105ff-a91d-4d40-bac9-b3019c83c7c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "1dfa13ed-f6ae-3b55-ad0e-9a4d6e9cea01",
